  "cancer-crosswalk — SSSOM crosswalk of cancer datasets against the HL7 Europe
   Cancer Common Data Model (ECCDM), 2026."

SOURCE DATASETS — NOT covered by this license
----------------------------------------------
The source datasets analysed here remain the property of, and under the terms of,
their respective publishers. This repository stores only *derived element
inventories* and *correspondence statements about* them, not the source
specifications themselves in full. Consult each source for its own terms:

  - oBDS (onkologischer Basisdatensatz), Gesellschaft der epidemiologischen
    Krebsregister / basisdatensatz.de
  - NABON Informatiestandaard borstkanker, NABON / Nictiz (ART-DECOR)
  - 1+MG Minimal Dataset for Cancer (B1MG), 1+Million Genomes / B1MG consortium,
    CC BY (see Zenodo record 10.5281/zenodo.10784601)
  - Senologie-Datenkranz / SenologieOnFHIR, BIH-CEI / Deutsche Krebsgesellschaft

ECCDM (the hub) is published by HL7 Europe; its logical models are used here for
analysis under the terms of the HL7 Europe Cancer Common IG.

DISCLAIMER
----------
All mappings are marked review_status=proposed and have NOT been validated by
domain experts. This is an analytical work product, not an authoritative or
normative mapping. Do not use it for production data transformation without
expert review.
